        "original_id": "5331a529-3c29-509a-862e-04393f26a7ab",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jerry Schumacher, Shalane Flanagan, Simon Bairu, Chris Solinsky, Matt Tegenkamp, Lisa Koll, Evan Jager\n- Organizations: Bowerman Track Club, Nike\n- Events: 2008 Olympics, 2010 New York City Marathon, 2011 IAAF World Cross Country Championships\n- Records: American women's 10k record, Canadian 10k record, men's American 10k record, men's American two mile record, women's NCAA 10k record\n\nFacts:\n- Shalane Flanagan won the bronze medal in the 10,000 m at the 2008 Olympics, and that medal was later upgraded to silver.\n- Shalane Flanagan finished second at the 2010 New York City Marathon.\n- Shalane Flanagan won a bronze medal at the 2011 IAAF World Cross Country Championships.\n- Jerry Schumacher has coached Shalane Flanagan, the former American women's 10k record holder.\n- Jerry Schumacher has coached Simon Bairu, the former Canadian 10k record holder.\n- Jerry Schumacher has coached Chris Solinsky, the former men's American 10k record holder.\n- Jerry Schumacher has coached Matt Tegenkamp, the men's American two mile record holder.\n- Jerry Schumacher has coached Lisa Koll, the women's NCAA 10k record holder.\n- Evan Jager is sponsored by Nike.\n- Evan Jager is coached by Jerry Schumacher in the Bowerman Track Club.",
